MECHANISM (★key: q4_K 84 cliff vs q6_K ~900 weight-bound?):
- UNTILED spill = 978 (-O2) / 983 (-O3). This is q6_K-MAGNITUDE (~900), an ORDER OF MAGNITUDE
  above the q4_K golden 84 / S1 23. maxVreg v31 (fully saturated, no spare register). q3_K is
  WEIGHT-RECONSTRUCTION-BOUND, not register-cliff-bound.
- TILED spill = 894 (-O2) / 910 (-O3). The S6 stack-panel (stage all 32 decoded signed-6bit-scale
  int16 vectors via vse16/vle16, defer reload to first use = the vwmacc_vv scale x weight-partial
  accumulation) shaved exactly ~84 spills (= the 32 staged scale strips + their reloads) but the
  ~894 RESIDUAL remains: spill did NOT reach ~0 (q2_K hit 7, q4_K hit 3), and maxVreg did NOT drop
  under 32 (v31 -> v31; q2_K/q4_K hit v30). The ≤32-vreg register cliff was NEVER reached.
- The ~894 residual = the two-plane 3-bit qs|hmask weight reconstruction (2048 vand + 2048 vsrl +
  1024 vsll + 1024 vor + 1024 vsub -> the i16 weight-partial-sums that are the OTHER operand of the
  256 vwmacc_vv), plus the f32 accumulator fan -- pressure the decode-scale panel does not touch.
- vwmacc 2176 UNCHANGED across all four -> byte-exact multiset preserved (confirmed by the silicon
  verify + identity dump). text shrank 75686->72464 (the staged scale spill/reload collapse).
- CONTRAST q6_K (cell l1-t3-q6k): its emitter panel spill ROSE 913->949 (+36); q3_K's clean minimal
  hand-panel FELL 978->894 (-84). Both are NULL ON THE CLIFF (spill stays ~900, maxVreg v31) -- the
  sign of the small delta differs but neither reaches the register cliff. q3_K rides the SAME q6_K
  no-min single-scale fold; it is q6_K-shaped, not q4_K/q2_K(min-fold)-shaped.
